  "display_title": "Regards From Angel",
  "description": "Jin, who had been regularly sending letters to an orphanage, suddenly realizes through Michael's unexpected visit that his letters had been misdelivered all along. After reading Jin's letters, Michael becomes curious about him. Attracted by Jin's appearance, he seduces him and they spend the night together. Michael wanted to see him again, but Jin refused, and ultimately, they parted ways after that one night. However, Jin, who kept thinking about Michael, eventually went back to find him...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: The second story in Lezhin's Jungnyeon Danpyeonseon (중년 단편선) Collection.*",
